   "text": "`Customer | custom · Customer Profile`\n*«Aggregate Root» «Entity»*\n**CustomerProfile**\n---\n+ id: string\n+ accountEmail: string\n+ identity: Identity\n+ address: Address\n+ kycInquiryId: string\n---\n+ enterProfileDetails(identity: Identity, address: Address): void\n+ sendSupportRequest(subject: string, message: string): SupportTicket",
